{
  "uid": "lb-realtime",
  "title": "LB — Request Masuk & Diterima (realtime)",
  "tags": [
    "load-balancer",
    "realtime",
    "prometheus"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Database",
      "url": "/d/db-monitoring",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Kesehatan MariaDB, replikasi, dan error query."
    },
    {
      "title": "Pengujian k6",
      "url": "/d/k6-lb",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Hasil Run k6 yang sedang dipilih."
    },
    {
      "title": "Run k6 (15 detik)",
      "url": "http://trigger.localhost/cgi-bin/trigger",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "Mulai satu Run k6: 100 req/detik selama 15 detik."
    },
    {
      "title": "Aplikasi",
      "url": "http://server.localhost",
      "icon": "external link",
      "type": "link",
      "targetBlank": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": false,
      "tooltip": "UI katalog server lewat Load Balancer."
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Cara baca (atas ke bawah)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**1. Kartu** = kesimpulan cepat. Hijau sehat, kuning waspada, merah perlu tindakan.\n**2. Grafik** = naik/turun trafik. Garis p95 di atas **0,5 detik** berarti Backend lambat.\n**3. Per Backend** = memastikan request benar-benar dibagi rata ke kelima Backend.\n**4. Alert + log** = penyebab error, tanpa pindah ke menu Explore.\n\nAngka **Masuk LB** dan **Diterima Backend** normalnya sama. Beda berarti ada **Failover Pasif** (request diulang) atau **Request Ditolak**; lihat panel Status code dan Log error.\nTrafik Grafana/Adminer/trigger dipisah di bagian terakhir supaya tidak mengaburkan penilaian Rotasi.",
        "code": {
          "language": "plaintext",
          "showLineNumbers": false,
          "showMiniMap": false
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "1. Apakah sistem sehat sekarang?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Backend sehat",
      "description": "**Arti**: jumlah Backend yang berstatus Sehat dan masuk Rotasi.\n**Normal**: 5 (semua Backend).\n**Jika < 5**: satu Backend keluar dari Rotasi; request tetap dilayani sisanya. Cek panel Status target scrape.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "count(up{job=\"backend\"} == 1) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error server (5xx) / detik",
      "description": "**Arti**: request aplikasi yang dijawab 5xx oleh Load Balancer atau Backend (4xx tidak dihitung: itu kesalahan klien).\n**Normal**: 0.\n**Jika > 0**: lihat panel Status code dan Log error di bawah.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.001
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_service_requests_total{service=~\"demo@docker|direct-.*@docker\",code=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Request masuk LB / detik",
      "description": "**Arti**: request aplikasi per detik yang masuk ke Load Balancer, termasuk jalur Router Langsung (`server-1.localhost`, ...).\n**Normal**: mengikuti beban yang sedang diberikan.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "blue"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(traefik_service_requests_total{service=~\"demo@docker|direct-.*@docker\"}[1m])) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latensi p95 Backend",
      "description": "**Arti**: 95% request selesai lebih cepat dari angka ini (histogram dari sisi Backend).\n**Normal**: < 0,2 detik untuk `/halo`.\n**Jika > 0,5 detik**: Backend atau database sedang lambat.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.2
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.5
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(lb_backend_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "2. Berapa trafik masuk dan bagaimana jawabannya?",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Masuk Load Balancer vs diterima Backend",
      "description": "**Arti**: garis \"Masuk\" dari Traefik, \"Diterima\" dari counter tiap Backend.\n**Normal**: kedua garis menempel.\n**Jika Masuk > Diterima**: ada retry (Failover Pasif) atau Request Ditolak. **Jika Diterima > Masuk**: kemungkinan probe/skrip internal; lihat panel trafik internal.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11
